# vmlab needs NO secrets.
#
# There is no database, no API key and no bearer token: the only credential in
# front of this is Authelia's session cookie, which Authelia owns. So there is
# no op:// item for this chart and no values.local.tpl.yaml — upgrade.sh calls
# sv_load only for the shape every other chart here has, and is happy when it
# finds nothing to inject.
#
# Things you might legitimately override locally:
#
# quota:
#   maxConcurrentVms: 2        # while the cluster is busy
#
# vm:
#   preferNodes: ["zachd-ubuntu-5"]
#
# NOTE: helm REPLACES lists rather than merging them. Overriding `catalog` here
# replaces the whole curated list, it does not add to it — same trap as
# dev/guacamole's `connections`. To add one VM, use the "+ New VM" button
# instead; those live in a separate ConfigMap that helm never touches.
